i><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasurePreservingSystem}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasurePreservingSystem}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9RohlinPartition}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9RohlinPartition}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}rohlin\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9RohlinPartition}_S(\\mathcal P,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,n,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasurePreservingSystem}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;(T(x)=y)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land B\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\;(T^i[B]\\cap T^j[B]=\\varnothing)\\land\\mathcal P=\\{T^i[B]:i&lt;n\\}\\cup\\left\\{X\\setminus\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}T^i[B]\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}rohlin\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9RohlinPartition}_S(\\mathcal P,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,n,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasurePreservingSystem}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;(T(x)=y)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land B\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\;(T^i[B]\\cap T^j[B]=\\varnothing)\\land\\mathcal P=\\{T^i[B]:i&lt;n\\}\\cup\\left\\{X\\setminus\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}T^i[B]\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The measure space is part of the signature rather than hidden existential data. Bijectivity makes all forward tower levels meaningful for the invertible measure-preserving transformation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure7-measure-preserving-system","status":"resolved","id":"e50d5390cadb5dd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure7-measure-preserving-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,n,B,\\mathcal P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0},\\quad B\\in\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasurePreservingSystem}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9RohlinPartition}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}rohlin\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9RohlinPartition}_S(\\mathcal P,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,n,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasurePreservingSystem}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists!x\\in X\\;(T(x)=y)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land B\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\forall i<j<n\\;(T^i[B]\\cap T^j[B]=\\varnothing)\\land\\mathcal P=\\{T^i[B]:i<n\\}\\cup\\left\\{X\\setminus\\bigcup_{i<n}T^i[B]\\right\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1402,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2677","loca